# Bot2 keeps a single Mox untapped after casting Duress: {1} is not the {2} Miscalculation asks, so it cannot pay.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Miscalculation
4 Island
10 Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Duress
4 Swamp
10 Swamp

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Miscalculation.Cast(Duress)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Decline

[Expect]
